            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Pick the class from your outages, then the size from your load list.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">Short and rare outages: a battery station or small inverter. Long, seasonal outages: a large portable with a transfer switch or interlock. Frequent multi-day outages, or someone at home who depends on power: automatic standby, often with a battery for medical loads.</p>
          </div>
